<title>INDONESIA: Polysindo says Q1 net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Polysindo says Q1 net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31</p>
<p>				  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Total operating revenue	466.29     vs     325.61</p>
<p>    Net income			  52.20     vs	44.13</p>
<p>    Gross profit		     135.65     vs     109.46</p>
<p>    Income from operations	 117.06     vs	97.11</p>
<p>    Other charges		    (53.49)    vs     (46.50)</p>
<p>    Minority interest		 (5.80)    vs	(3.69)</p>
<p>Note: The results were unaudited. PT Polysindo Eka Perkasa is Indonesia's largest polyster producer.</p>
</text>
